    metaTitle: "What Is Website User Flow? Complete Guide 2026",
    metaDescription: "Learn what website user flow is, why it matters for UX, and how to create effective user flows. Includes examples, tools, and best practices.",
    keywords: "website user flow, user flow definition, UX flow, what is user flow, user journey mapping",
    h1: "What Is Website User Flow? A Complete Guide",
    publishDate: "2026-02-15",
